msgid "Dbg"
msgstr "디버그"

#: Source/Editor/Viewport/Visualizers/DebugDrawVisualizer.cpp
msgctxt "EdVisualizer.DebugDrawTip"
msgid "Shows the lines, spheres, boxes, arrows and text game code put into DebugDrawQueue"
msgstr "게임 코드가 DebugDrawQueue 에 넣은 선 · 구 · 상자 · 화살표 · 글자를 표시합니다"

#: Source/Editor/Viewport/Visualizers/NavMeshVisualizer.cpp
