msgid "Nav"
msgstr "내비"

#: Source/Editor/Viewport/Visualizers/NavMeshVisualizer.cpp
msgctxt "EdVisualizer.NavMeshTip"
msgid "Shows the polygon edges of the baked navmesh (bake with Build > Bake Navigation)"
msgstr "베이크한 내비메시의 폴리곤 테두리를 표시합니다(빌드 > 내비게이션 굽기로 굽는다)"

#: Source/Editor/Viewport/Visualizers/PhysicsShapeVisualizer.cpp
