msgid "Phys"
msgstr "물리"

#: Source/Editor/Viewport/Visualizers/PhysicsShapeVisualizer.cpp
msgctxt "EdVisualizer.PhysicsShapesTip"
msgid "Shows RigidBody and RigidBody2D collision shapes as wireframe (static grey, kinematic blue, dynamic green, trigger yellow)"
msgstr "RigidBody · RigidBody2D 의 충돌 셰이프를 와이어프레임으로 표시합니다(정적 회색 · 키네마틱 파랑 · 동적 초록 · 트리거 노랑)"

#: Source/Editor/Viewport/Visualizers/RigTargetGizmoVisualizer.cpp
