msgctxt "EditorInspector.NothingSelected"
msgid "Nothing selected. Pick in the Scene view or use Hierarchy."
msgstr "선택한 것이 없습니다. 씬 뷰에서 고르거나 Hierarchy 를 쓰세요."

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Inspector/InspectorPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorInspector.ObjectActive"
msgid "Toggle whether the GameObject is active"
msgstr "게임오브젝트의 활성화 상태를 토글합니다"

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Inspector/InspectorPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorInspector.ObjectName"
msgid "Unique name of the GameObject (Enter to apply)"
msgstr "게임오브젝트의 고유 이름 (Enter 키로 적용)"

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Inspector/InspectorPropertyManager.cpp
