#: Source/Editor/Panels/Scene/PrefabPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorScene.ExitIsolation"
msgid "Leave isolation mode without saving the prefab"
msgstr "프리팹을 저장하지 않고 격리 모드를 나갑니다"

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Scene/GameViewPanel.cpp
