msgstr "이 씬에 이 시퀀스를 재생하는 Sequence Player 가 없습니다. 오브젝트를 바인딩하고 미리 보려면 하나 더하세요."

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.NoBindingsHint"
msgid "No bindings. Select an object and add a binding from it."
msgstr "바인딩이 없습니다. 오브젝트를 선택하고 그것으로 바인딩을 더하세요."

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.NoCutsHint"
msgid "No camera cuts. Select a camera binding and add a cut."
msgstr "카메라 컷이 없습니다. 카메라 바인딩을 선택하고 컷을 더하세요."

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.NoKeyTracksHint"
msgid "No key tracks. Select an object and add a transform or property track."
msgstr "키 트랙이 없습니다. 오브젝트를 선택하고 트랜스폼 트랙이나 프로퍼티 트랙을 추가합니다."

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.OpenCurveTip"
msgid "Open this channel in the curve editor to shape the interpolation between keys."
msgstr "이 채널을 커브 편집기에서 열어 키 사이의 보간을 다듬습니다."

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.PasteItem"
msgid "Paste item"
msgstr "항목 붙여 넣기"

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.PasteItemTip"
msgid "Paste the copied item so it starts at the current frame. Spawn items cannot be pasted: each spawned object needs its own binding."
msgstr "복사한 항목을 현재 프레임에서 시작하게 붙여 넣습니다. 생성 항목은 붙여 넣을 수 없습니다 — 생성한 오브젝트마다 바인딩이 따로 있어야 합니다."

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.PasteKeys"
msgid "Paste keys"
msgstr "키 붙여 넣기"

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.PasteKeysTip"
msgid "Paste the copied keys at the current frame, starting at the selected track. Tracks with a different channel count are skipped."
msgstr "복사한 키를 고른 트랙부터 현재 프레임에 붙여 넣습니다. 채널 수가 다른 트랙은 건너뜁니다."

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.PauseTip"
msgid "Pause playback at the current frame."
msgstr "현재 프레임에서 재생을 일시정지합니다."

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.PlayTip"
msgid "Play the sequence in the viewport from the current frame, looping at the end."
msgstr "현재 프레임부터 뷰포트에서 시퀀스를 재생하고, 끝에 닿으면 처음부터 반복합니다."

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.PrefabTip"
msgid "Prefab spawned for this span. Type its resource id or drop it from the content browser."
msgstr "이 구간 동안 스폰할 프리팹입니다. 리소스 id 를 치거나 콘텐츠 브라우저에서 끌어다 놓습니다."

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.PresetTip"
msgid "Id of the appearance preset the target object wears."
msgstr "대상 오브젝트가 입을 외형 프리셋의 id 입니다."

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.PreviousKeyTip"
msgid "Go to the previous key"
msgstr "앞 키로"

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.PropertyLabel"
msgid "Property"
msgstr "프로퍼티"

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.PropertyPathTip"
msgid "<ComponentType>.<Property> - a float32 or int32 property (for example CameraComponent._fov)"
msgstr "<컴포넌트 타입>.<프로퍼티> — float32 · int32 프로퍼티(예: CameraComponent._fov)"

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.PropertyTargetNotFound"
msgid "Target or numeric property not found"
msgstr "대상이나 숫자 프로퍼티를 찾을 수 없습니다"

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.RequiredFieldHint"
msgid "A required field is empty. Leaving it empty restores the previous value."
msgstr "필수 칸이 비었습니다. 비운 채 떠나면 이전 값으로 돌아갑니다."

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.RigSlotLabel"
msgid "Rig slot"
msgstr "리그 칸"

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.RigSlotTargetNotFound"
msgid "Target has no Pose Modifier"
msgstr "대상에 Pose Modifier 가 없습니다"

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.RigSlotTip"
msgid "Rig slot name (weight_slot in the rig asset); value is clamped to 0..1"
msgstr "리그 슬롯 이름(리그 에셋의 weight_slot), 값은 0..1 로 자릅니다"

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.SaveTip"
msgid "Write the sequence to the focused .seq file."
msgstr "시퀀스를 포커스된 .seq 파일에 씁니다."

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.ScenarioLabel"
msgid "Scenario"
msgstr "시나리오"

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.ScenarioTip"
msgid "Scenario played when the start frame is crossed. Type its resource id or drop it from the content browser."
msgstr "시작 프레임을 지날 때 재생할 시나리오입니다. 리소스 id 를 치거나 콘텐츠 브라우저에서 끌어다 놓습니다."

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.ScrubTip"
msgid "Drag to move the current frame; the viewport follows so you can check any moment of the sequence."
msgstr "끌어서 현재 프레임을 옮깁니다. 뷰포트가 따라오므로 시퀀스의 어느 순간이든 확인할 수 있습니다."

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.SelectItemHint"
msgid "Select an item on the timeline to edit it."
msgstr "편집하려면 타임라인에서 항목을 선택합니다."

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.ShotCameraColumn"
msgid "Camera"
msgstr "카메라"

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.ShotEndColumn"
msgid "End"
msgstr "끝"

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.ShotLengthColumn"
msgid "Frames"
msgstr "프레임"

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.ShotStartColumn"
msgid "Start"
msgstr "시작"

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.SoundLabel"
msgid "Sound"
msgstr "소리"

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.SoundTip"
msgid "Audio event posted when the start frame is crossed and stopped when the span ends."
msgstr "시작 프레임을 지날 때 보내고 구간이 끝나면 멈추는 오디오 이벤트입니다."

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.SpawnBindingTip"
msgid "Binding the spawned object fills; its name is the binding name."
msgstr "스폰한 오브젝트가 채울 바인딩입니다. 오브젝트 이름은 바인딩 이름입니다."

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.SpawnedBinding"
msgid "Spawned by the sequence"
msgstr "시퀀스가 스폰함"

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.SplitCut"
msgid "Split cut"
msgstr "컷 나누기"

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.SplitCutTip"
msgid "Split the camera cut under the current frame into two shots with the same camera."
msgstr "현재 프레임 아래의 카메라 컷을 같은 카메라의 두 샷으로 나눕니다."

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.StopTip"
msgid "Stop playback, return to the first frame and give the camera back from any camera cut."
msgstr "재생을 멈추고 첫 프레임으로 돌아가며, 카메라 컷이 가져간 카메라를 돌려줍니다."

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.TargetNotFound"
msgid "Target object not found"
msgstr "대상 오브젝트를 찾을 수 없습니다"

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.TextLabel"
msgid "Text"
msgstr "글"

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.TextTip"
msgid "Localization key (Namespace.Key) of the subtitle line shown for the span."
msgstr "구간 동안 보일 자막 줄의 현지화 키(Namespace.Key)입니다."

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.TrackIssueChannelCount"
msgid "Wrong channel count for the kind. The file will not load; delete and add the track again."
msgstr "종류에 맞지 않는 채널 수입니다. 파일이 읽히지 않습니다 — 트랙을 지우고 다시 더하세요."

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.TrackIssueKeysOutsideTimeline"
msgid "Some keys are outside the timeline and never play. Move them inside or widen the timeline."
msgstr "타임라인 밖의 키가 있어 재생되지 않습니다. 안으로 옮기거나 타임라인을 넓히세요."

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.TrackIssueMissingBinding"
msgid "The track's binding is not in this sequence. The file will not load; delete the track."
msgstr "트랙의 바인딩이 이 시퀀스에 없습니다. 파일이 읽히지 않습니다 — 트랙을 지우세요."

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.TrackIssueMissingPropertyPath"
msgid "No target path. Playback drives nothing; enter the property or rig slot."
msgstr "대상 경로가 없습니다. 재생해도 아무것도 움직이지 않습니다 — 프로퍼티나 리그 칸을 적으세요."

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.TrackIssueUnknownKind"
msgid "Unknown track kind. The file will not load; delete the track."
msgstr "모르는 트랙 종류입니다. 파일이 읽히지 않습니다 — 트랙을 지우세요."

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.TrackNameLabel"
msgid "Name"
msgstr "이름"

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.TrackTargetLabel"
msgid "Target"
msgstr "대상"

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.UnboundBinding"
msgid "Unbound"
msgstr "바인딩 안 됨"

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.ViewRangeFormat"
msgid "First frame %d"
msgstr "첫 프레임 %d"

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.ViewScrollTip"
msgid "Scroll the zoomed view. Shift+wheel over the key strips scrolls too."
msgstr "확대한 보기를 굴립니다. 키 띠 위에서 Shift+휠로도 굴립니다."

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.ZoomFit"
msgid "Fit"
msgstr "맞춤"

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.ZoomFitTip"
msgid "Show the whole timeline."
msgstr "타임라인 전체를 봅니다."

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.ZoomIn"
msgid "Zoom in"
msgstr "확대"

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.ZoomInTip"
msgid "Show fewer frames around the current frame. Ctrl+wheel over the key strips zooms at the pointer."
msgstr "현재 프레임 둘레의 프레임을 더 적게 봅니다. 키 띠 위에서 Ctrl+휠은 포인터 자리에서 확대합니다."

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.ZoomOut"
msgid "Zoom out"
msgstr "축소"

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Animation/SequencerPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSequencer.ZoomOutTip"
msgid "Show more frames."
msgstr "프레임을 더 많이 봅니다."

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Settings/ModulesPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSettings.BuildModules"
msgid "Compile every module with the changed module set"
msgstr "바뀐 모듈 구성으로 모든 모듈을 컴파일합니다"

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Settings/GlobalVariablesPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSettings.FilterVariablesHint"
msgid "Filter variables..."
msgstr "변수 필터..."

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Settings/GlobalVariablesPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSettings.GroupByModule"
msgid "Group the variables by the module that defines them"
msgstr "변수를 정의한 모듈별로 묶습니다"

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Settings/ModulesPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSettings.ModuleChangeNoCascade"
msgid "No other modules change."
msgstr "다른 모듈은 바뀌지 않습니다."

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Settings/ModulesPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSettings.ModuleChangeTarget"
msgid "Module"
msgstr "모듈"

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Settings/ModulesPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSettings.ModuleChangeTurnsOff"
msgid "Also turns off"
msgstr "함께 꺼짐"

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Settings/ModulesPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSettings.ModuleChangeTurnsOn"
msgid "Also turns on"
msgstr "함께 켜짐"

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Settings/ModulesPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSettings.ModuleDefaultState"
msgid "Default"
msgstr "기본값"

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Settings/ModulesPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSettings.ModuleDependencies"
msgid "Depends on"
msgstr "의존 모듈"

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Settings/ModulesPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSettings.ModuleDependents"
msgid "Required by"
msgstr "이 모듈에 의존하는 모듈"

#: Source/Editor/Panels/Settings/ModulesPanel.cpp
msgctxt "EditorSettings.ModuleKindAll"
